{"id":"1242103196649603072","identityId":"1242294789908504576","name":"漂泊者-女-湮灭","displayName":"漂泊者 · 女","romanizedName":"ROVER","description":"身世不明的共鸣者，拥有吸收一切声音的力量。 为了寻回记忆而踏上旅途。","resonanceName":"声之容器","gender":"女","origin":"未知","identity":"未知","affiliation":"未知","specialty":"","weapon":"迅刀","element":"湮灭","releaseVersion":"V1.0","cv":{"中文":"张若瑜","日文":"田中美海","英文":"Jane Jackson","韩文":"Song Ha Rim"},"avatar":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/newHead/aki/woman.png","width":500,"height":500,"fallbackUrl":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/608cd7adc67f4b6eb84857ff0ff4b74920251118.png"},"hero":{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/d4fd736ac8b94e7cb758861191dbd0c820240521.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},"poster":null,"artworks":[{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/0b7f7b7434934919a3b6a03f8ed11ebc20240521.png","label":"立绘","kind":"portrait","orientation":"desktop","width":719,"height":713},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/d4fd736ac8b94e7cb758861191dbd0c820240521.png","label":"编队立绘","kind":"team","orientation":"desktop","width":1129,"height":1654},{"url":"https://prod-alicdn-community.kurobbs.com/forum/6482fcb0d13c4042bdd55701636865c020240521.png","label":"编队立绘 · 移动版","kind":"team","orientation":"mobile","width":1129,"height":1654}],"archives":[{"id":"1242103196649603072-lore-9-0","title":"检验鉴定","html":"<p><span><span><strong>未知</strong></span></span></p>","images":[]}],"treasures":[{"id":"1242103196649603072-lore-10-0","title":"未知","html":"<p><span><strong>未知</strong></span></p>","images":[]}],"stories":[],"outfits":[],"voices":[{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886345680637952","title":"闲趣1","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675139274964.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886345776652288","title":"闲趣2","text":"它是我与这世界的连结，见证我所经历的一切。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675152667662.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886346146205696","title":"闲趣3","text":"（语气词）","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575675166272412.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886327888883712","title":"入队1","text":"路途还很遥远，继续前进吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670894286342.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886327900528640","title":"入队2","text":"新的发现吗？","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670896242343.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886328190390272","title":"入队3","text":"我想留在大家身边……从过去，一同迈向明天。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575670924119855.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886303619702784","title":"突破1","text":"世界……似乎变得更加清晰。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665099229446.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886303423025152","title":"突破2","text":"这股力量虽有些不可思议，却让我感到十分的安心。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665051181173.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886303377371136","title":"突破3","text":"我还需要更多的时间去了解、熟悉这陌生的世界。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665040257245.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886303661645824","title":"突破4","text":"又是新的旅途吗？新的声音，新的故事，还有……碎片般的记忆。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665090803683.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-11-0-1440886303411204096","title":"突破5","text":"陆止于此，海始于斯，我们的旅途还远未结束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575665043271889.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"personality"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886108803125248","title":"重击1","text":"揭开帷幕。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575618669534027.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886108707139584","title":"重击2","text":"就此消失！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575618647573373.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886085831405568","title":"共鸣技能1","text":"破！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613198178835.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886085906419712","title":"共鸣技能2","text":"消散吧。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613207265243.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886085985656832","title":"共鸣技能3","text":"声形回束。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613225878121.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886085915291648","title":"共鸣技能4","text":"破绽百出。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613206525430.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086015016960","title":"共鸣技能5","text":"不要犹豫。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613229846819.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886085823295488","title":"共鸣技能6","text":"和光尘影。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613206234629.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086288863232","title":"共鸣技能7","text":"随影而来。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613322609292.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086422802432","title":"共鸣技能8","text":"胜负已定。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613307258759.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086552342528","title":"共鸣技能9","text":"不再犹豫！","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613358384692.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086553104384","title":"共鸣技能10","text":"无所遁形。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613372817425.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086522527744","title":"共鸣技能11","text":"从未破灭。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613355945089.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886086506967040","title":"共鸣技能12","text":"随影而去。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575613372291149.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886064033124352","title":"共鸣解放1","text":"回声，于此共鸣。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575607992970087.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886064015892480","title":"共鸣解放2","text":"弥光之际。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575607994853509.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886064335876096","title":"共鸣解放3","text":"已至终时。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575608003631370.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{"id":"1242103196649603072-voice-12-0-1440886064250773504","title":"共鸣解放4","text":"化羽，湮灭万律。","url":"https://web-static.kurobbs.com/wiki_audio/1763575607998463738.wav","language":"中文","cv":"张若瑜","category":"combat"},{